        <mxCell id="n2" value="&lt;b&gt;Network Orchestration for AWS Transit Gateway (STNO) v3.3.28 — multi-account hub-and-spoke&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;NET-020 · us-east-1 · topology generalised from a production support case — every identifier below is synthetic" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;fontColor=#232F3E;" parent="1" vertex="1">
